1
00:00:01,606 --> 00:00:04,370
Operation Underground Battle

2
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:14,589
Wow!

3
00:00:15,909 --> 00:00:17,707
It's a drone with a camera!

4
00:00:17,707 --> 00:00:19,268
I got it yesterday.

5
00:00:19,268 --> 00:00:23,687
With this, we can find the robot hiding in the forest from a safe distance.

6
00:00:23,687 --> 00:00:25,728
Uh... about that robot...

7
00:00:25,728 --> 00:00:29,795
You lost it, didn't you? I heard from Sebastian.

8
00:00:29,795 --> 00:00:32,524
I'm... just so glad you're okay, Crest!

9
00:00:32,524 --> 00:00:34,707
Yeah, we were so worried!

10
00:00:34,707 --> 00:00:39,448
I think that forest is too dangerous. It's best we stay away from it from now on.

11
00:00:39,448 --> 00:00:41,411
Yeah, I think so too.

12
00:00:41,411 --> 00:00:45,710
But that robot said it hated humans. We can't just ignore it.

13
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:49,832
I wonder just how much Crest knows about the Metal Cardbots.

14
00:00:50,792 --> 00:00:51,634
Uncle Edo!

15
00:00:51,703 --> 00:00:53,725
The monster turned out to be a Metal Cardbot after all.

16
00:00:53,725 --> 00:00:55,399
Let go of him!

17
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,292
Wait up, Crest!

18
00:00:57,661 --> 00:01:00,902
He didn't seem surprised at all.

19
00:01:03,002 --> 00:01:04,243
What was that?

20
00:01:07,682 --> 00:01:08,623
Is that?...

21
00:01:16,269 --> 00:01:18,489
Mega Ambler? What's going on?

22
00:01:18,489 --> 00:01:19,373
Jun. It's an emergency.

23
00:01:19,373 --> 00:01:21,513
A water main burst and water is gushing out.

24
00:01:21,513 --> 00:01:22,786
The cause is unknown.

25
00:01:33,722 --> 00:01:37,432
There's a sinkhole here too. I don't think I can handle this on my own!

26
00:01:37,432 --> 00:01:38,831
Please send help!

27
00:01:38,831 --> 00:01:40,823
Alright. I'll be there right away.

28
00:01:48,924 --> 00:01:50,182
Huh?! What's that?!

29
00:01:53,271 --> 00:01:54,295
Dexter?!

30
00:01:54,859 --> 00:01:55,962
Who is it?!

31
00:01:57,519 --> 00:02:00,174
So you've been causing these sinkholes all over town!

32
00:02:00,174 --> 00:02:02,340
Shut up!

33
00:02:11,228 --> 00:02:12,317
Got it. Over.

34
00:02:12,317 --> 00:02:13,282
What's going on?!

35
00:02:13,282 --> 00:02:14,569
It was Dexter.

36
00:02:14,569 --> 00:02:17,680
Wasn't he trying to protect the animals?

37
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,396
Why did he come all the way to Mowtown?!

38
00:02:19,396 --> 00:02:22,859
I think it might be trying to destroy the roads to protect the animals.

39
00:02:22,859 --> 00:02:26,179
People aren't stopping the road construction despite all the warnings,

40
00:02:26,179 --> 00:02:30,150
so it's trying to destroy all the roads for the animal's sake.

41
00:02:31,336 --> 00:02:33,420
Wait, show us a map of the town!

42
00:02:35,115 --> 00:02:37,507
These are the places that sinkholes appeared.

43
00:02:37,507 --> 00:02:40,348
Let's connect them and see if we can figure something out.

44
00:02:42,699 --> 00:02:44,402
Looks like there's no pattern.

45
00:02:44,402 --> 00:02:49,210
Dexter's eyes were damaged when Wild Guardy attacked.

46
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:53,382
He probably doesn't even know where he's going.

47
00:02:53,382 --> 00:02:57,560
Isn't that... all the more reason to destroy the robot?

48
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,531
So we can prevent it from causing any more damage?

49
00:02:59,531 --> 00:03:03,270
He's not just a robot! He's a mechanical lifeform from planet Machina!

50
00:03:03,270 --> 00:03:05,456
We should try our best to persuade to him!

51
00:03:05,456 --> 00:03:07,179
Do you really think he'll listen?

52
00:03:07,179 --> 00:03:09,776
Dexter's heart is in the right place for wanting to protect the animals.

53
00:03:09,776 --> 00:03:11,752
He just chose the wrong way to go about it.

54
00:03:11,752 --> 00:03:13,364
But what if we can't persuade him?

55
00:03:13,364 --> 00:03:15,853
We'll stop him, even if it means fighting.

56
00:03:15,853 --> 00:03:18,894
Whether you want to talk or fight, you have to find it first.

57
00:03:18,894 --> 00:03:22,650
How will you find it when it's burrowed deep underground.

58
00:03:22,650 --> 00:03:23,795
That's why I have a plan.

59
00:03:23,795 --> 00:03:25,602
Operation Underground Battle!

60
00:03:25,602 --> 00:03:28,639
Operation Underground Battle?

61
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:31,937
For this operation to succeed...

62
00:03:31,937 --> 00:03:34,372
Crest. We'll need your help.

63
00:03:36,283 --> 00:03:38,479
What is that on top of the drone?

64
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:41,280
It's an ultrasonic generator used to repel moles.

65
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,765
I got it because Jun said he needed one.

66
00:03:43,765 --> 00:03:46,216
The drone will take this into one of the sinkholes.

67
00:03:46,216 --> 00:03:50,848
Dexter is relying on sound to get around.

68
00:03:50,848 --> 00:03:52,133
So this should get him to pop right up out of the ground!

69
00:03:53,182 --> 00:03:56,127
Here's the map of the sewers! I got it from my dad.

70
00:03:56,127 --> 00:03:57,432
Thank you!

71
00:03:57,432 --> 00:04:01,413
But how will we be able to communicate with the drone while it's underground?

72
00:04:01,413 --> 00:04:04,520
Worry not. Allow me to take care of that.

73
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,186
Sebastian?

74
00:04:09,655 --> 00:04:11,723
I have memorized the map.

75
00:04:11,723 --> 00:04:12,776
Thank you.

76
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,098
I'll be off then!

77
00:04:17,528 --> 00:04:19,329
Let's get going too!

78
00:04:36,699 --> 00:04:38,586
We have a signal on the radar.

79
00:04:40,997 --> 00:04:42,750
Is it Dexter?

80
00:04:44,514 --> 00:04:45,951
It's big...

81
00:04:45,951 --> 00:04:46,858
It's coming!

82
00:04:55,187 --> 00:04:57,206
It's just a rat...

83
00:04:59,882 --> 00:05:01,507
How are things going out here?

84
00:05:01,507 --> 00:05:03,168
Shall we try again?

85
00:05:05,181 --> 00:05:06,588
Is that?...

86
00:05:14,490 --> 00:05:15,430
There it is!

87
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:17,250
Wow...! A, uh, robot!

88
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,552
It looks dangerous, let's run!

89
00:05:18,552 --> 00:05:21,346
W-wait up! But we finally found Dexter!

90
00:05:21,346 --> 00:05:24,283
Huh? Is that the little human?

91
00:05:24,569 --> 00:05:26,586
Yaah!

92
00:05:26,586 --> 00:05:30,834
What the-? Make that awful noise stop already!

93
00:05:30,834 --> 00:05:34,187
Dexter! We don't want to fight you!

94
00:05:34,187 --> 00:05:36,730
We'll find a way to protect the animals!

95
00:05:36,730 --> 00:05:39,389
So please stop attacking innocent people!

96
00:05:39,389 --> 00:05:42,175
What? Humans protecting the animals?

97
00:05:42,175 --> 00:05:43,625
Don't make me laugh!

98
00:05:43,625 --> 00:05:45,538
Dexter! Listen to me!

99
00:05:45,538 --> 00:05:48,901
Metal Cardbots have to learn to coexist with humans,

100
00:05:48,901 --> 00:05:50,502
so we can live in peace on this planet together!

101
00:05:50,502 --> 00:05:53,218
No! Humans can't be trusted!

102
00:05:56,584 --> 00:06:00,211
Master of the Metal Breath! You're just lying so you can capture me too!

103
00:06:01,377 --> 00:06:03,411
Uh-oh. If it can't be helped...

104
00:06:03,411 --> 00:06:05,564
Then I'll have to do this! Shadow X!

105
00:06:05,564 --> 00:06:07,454
Stealth mode, off!

106
00:06:08,911 --> 00:06:09,980
Stop right there!

107
00:06:10,158 --> 00:06:11,218
When did you...

108
00:06:11,218 --> 00:06:14,769
We were prepared in case you wouldn't listen to us!

109
00:06:14,769 --> 00:06:14,995
Haha!

110
00:06:14,995 --> 00:06:18,153
He's been standing by since before we began this operation!

111
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:22,237
Looks like there will be a fight after all.

112
00:06:22,237 --> 00:06:24,341
Jun... please take care of things here.

113
00:06:24,341 --> 00:06:25,971
Huh?

114
00:06:28,579 --> 00:06:31,495
Hey you! Let us seal you already!

115
00:06:31,495 --> 00:06:33,519
Over my dead body!

116
00:06:35,886 --> 00:06:37,761
He can use his shovel like that?!

117
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:39,790
Huh?

118
00:06:40,855 --> 00:06:42,605
Tch. Where did he go?

119
00:06:42,605 --> 00:06:45,125
Hiding is supposed to be my thing!

120
00:06:48,269 --> 00:06:50,201
I can't use my main camera.

121
00:06:50,201 --> 00:06:54,677
But my sound wave device can detect where you are!

122
00:06:56,427 --> 00:06:57,326
There you are!

123
00:07:01,168 --> 00:07:02,750
Hey! Let go!

124
00:07:03,615 --> 00:07:05,221
Come back, Shadow X!

125
00:07:08,781 --> 00:07:10,365
Your turn, Phoenix Fire!

126
00:07:14,925 --> 00:07:16,509
Just try and follow me!

127
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,855
He went back underground!

128
00:07:21,336 --> 00:07:24,209
Dexter is tracking our location through sound...

129
00:07:24,211 --> 00:07:24,210
!

130
00:07:24,309 --> 00:07:25,564
In that case.

131
00:07:25,987 --> 00:07:28,598
Phoenix Fire! Hammer Quake!

132
00:07:29,387 --> 00:07:30,209
Hammer...

133
00:07:30,209 --> 00:07:31,161
Quake!

134
00:07:32,826 --> 00:07:34,590
Augh!

135
00:07:34,590 --> 00:07:36,595
Phoenix Fire! Keep hitting the ground!

136
00:07:36,595 --> 00:07:39,360
Hammer Quake! And another!

137
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,326
Augh! Stop it!

138
00:07:46,408 --> 00:07:47,441
Behind you!

139
00:07:47,990 --> 00:07:49,747
Water Splash!

140
00:07:50,115 --> 00:07:51,588
Augh!

141
00:07:53,343 --> 00:07:54,579
Way to go!

142
00:08:00,607 --> 00:08:02,471
Your up, Mega Ambler!

143
00:08:06,737 --> 00:08:09,540
Mega Ambler! Stop him from going back underground!

144
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:11,307
Got it. Leave it to me!

145
00:08:18,398 --> 00:08:20,810
Forceps Crush!

146
00:08:21,802 --> 00:08:23,305
Let go of me!

147
00:08:27,901 --> 00:08:29,160
Oh no!

148
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:29,995
Great job, guys!

149
00:08:35,822 --> 00:08:37,551
Metal Breath, pickup!

150
00:08:39,808 --> 00:08:40,793
Blue Cop, setup!

151
00:08:47,908 --> 00:08:50,711
Dexter! It's time to settle this!

152
00:08:50,913 --> 00:08:52,277
You!

153
00:08:52,485 --> 00:08:53,441
Blue Cop!

154
00:09:00,346 --> 00:09:01,697
Infinity...

155
00:09:01,697 --> 00:09:03,100
Force...

156
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:04,355
Break!!

157
00:09:20,206 --> 00:09:21,985
Metal Cardbot...

158
00:09:21,985 --> 00:09:23,163
Change Up!

159
00:09:41,975 --> 00:09:43,831
Dexter-

160
00:09:43,831 --> 00:09:45,504
Sealed!

161
00:10:01,431 --> 00:10:03,171
Now, what do you see?

162
00:10:03,686 --> 00:10:05,426
What?

163
00:10:05,426 --> 00:10:07,149
A gorilla waving?

164
00:10:07,499 --> 00:10:09,134
Looks like he's been fixed!

165
00:10:09,134 --> 00:10:10,413
What do you mean by that?

166
00:10:10,912 --> 00:10:12,254
Thank you guys.

167
00:10:12,254 --> 00:10:14,336
I really owe you an apology.

168
00:10:14,336 --> 00:10:16,490
Hey, don't worry about it.

169
00:10:16,490 --> 00:10:19,431
If there's anything on your mind, you can tell us.

170
00:10:19,431 --> 00:10:21,668
You guys were able to help me...

171
00:10:21,668 --> 00:10:25,333
But what will happen to the animals of the forest when the road is finished?

172
00:10:25,335 --> 00:10:25,334
!

173
00:10:25,433 --> 00:10:27,903
I have something to show you. Come with me!

174
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,588
We're here!

175
00:10:38,701 --> 00:10:39,658
What?

176
00:10:40,269 --> 00:10:45,211
This underpass has been designed to allow wild animals to cross safely, Dexter.

177
00:10:45,211 --> 00:10:50,793
Humans also thought of a way to keep the wild animals safe.

178
00:10:50,793 --> 00:10:54,731
I see the people of this planet have shown a little consideration after all.

179
00:10:54,731 --> 00:10:56,561
Do you feel better now?

180
00:10:56,561 --> 00:10:58,899
Yeah. From now on...

181
00:10:58,899 --> 00:11:00,546
I will join you as a part of your team.

182
00:11:01,345 --> 00:11:03,993
Haha! Glad to have you!

